"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">The unit that gets used to measure altitude, lengths and distances (e.g. km, mi, ft).</p>"
